. * -- rdrobust: CCT MSE-optimal bandwidth ----------------------------
. * rdrobust selects the MSE-optimal bandwidth (MSERD) and computes
. * bias-corrected robust CIs following Calonico, Cattaneo & Titiunik
. * (2014, Econometrica).
