. * Fig. 10.7 IS now exported.  The long-standing r(198) came from passing a
. * full filename to graph_export() instead of the (prefix, filetype) pair it
. * expects; sdid draws normally in do-file context once the syntax is right.
. * sdid appends its own suffix, hence fig10_7_sdid_trends2018.png.
. *
. * NAMING CONVENTION.  Two families share the fig10_ prefix and are told
. * apart by how many numeric components follow it:
. *   fig10_<N>_<name>        N  = MANUSCRIPT FIGURE number  (the five above)
